					<summary class="faq__summary">
						<span class="faq__question">Что будет, если не пройти ВВК или отбор?</span>
						<span class="faq__toggle" aria-hidden="true">
							<img class="faq__toggle-icon faq__toggle-icon--plus" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==" data-lazy-src="{theme}/images/31b51c2de40f6e5efd7f2cee8407bea4e285dce2.svg" alt="" width="24" height="24" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
							<img class="faq__toggle-icon faq__toggle-icon--minus" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==" data-lazy-src="{theme}/images/4e233ad3c0e34ef38125cbe0c0f900b1a75f6483.svg" alt="" width="24" height="24" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
